{
  "release": "Theme 1.32.2 (Design Library R-7: OFL-rendered media, new fictional brand names, Frosted Glass UI title; publish gate stays closed)",
  "note": "Theme only, on production 1.32.1 (release commit 1aa10bb, deployed 2026-11-23 01:06 JST; main 1aa10bb). Baseline: the 1.32.1 release manifest (291 files, sha256 9eb40169..., rebuilt byte-identical from 1aa10bb and identical to the deploy record). Core stays 1.10.0. 1 added and 73 replaced files: first assets/data/design/.htaccess (added: denies HTTP access to catalog.json and catalog.schema.json; WordPress reads the catalog by file path), then 17 demo files (brand names; liquid-glass sparkle drawn as inline SVG), 54 media (posters, card loops, videos re-rendered with Noto Sans JP / Noto Serif JP, SIL OFL 1.1), catalog.json (names, title, demo SHA-256), then style.css last (version 1.32.2, switch file). The 1.32.1 changes (inc/seo.php, inc/learn-composer.php) are not touched and ship as they are. No PHP logic changes, no new rewrite rule, no database change, publish gate stays closed (/design/ 404).",
